    "summary": "The chunking subsystem deterministically converts a ParsedDocument into content-addressed Chunks. It groups parsed blocks by heading path so no chunk crosses a section boundary, greedily packs whole blocks within a token budget with trailing overlap, splits oversized blocks by binary prefix search, and enriches text with reconstructed Markdown headings for embedding while stamping config-version and document-derived identity digests.",
